  "intuition": "Replace the cost-gap linear penalty inside the logits with a smooth multiplicative margin on the preference logit: x = alpha*scale*(lpw-lpl) * (1 + k*tanh(gap/tau)). This keeps the base pairwise logsigmoid form but adaptively increases the effective margin when the (detached) cost gap indicates a stronger preference signal, while bounding the modulation for stability via tanh and clamping.",
